        "problem": "Find the exact value of ${cos}^{2}\u2061({75}^{\u2218})-{sin}^{2}\u2061({75}^{\u2218}).$",
        "worked_solution": "First, let's recall the double-angle formula for cosine:\n\n$$\n{cos}^{2}\u2061x-{sin}^{2}\u2061x=\\operatorname{cos}\u20612x\n$$\n\nSubstituting $x={75}^{\u2218}$ into the above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{cos}^{2}\u2061({75}^{\u2218})-{sin}^{2}\u2061({75}^{\u2218}) & =\\operatorname{cos}\u2061(2\\cdot {75}^{\u2218}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}\u2061{150}^{\u2218} \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
